  evidenceId: EVD_ScenePhotos
  displayName: Crime scene photographs
  category: 1
  description: 'Scene photographs pinned to the evidence board: the office door,
    the victim''s desk and the side table.'
  locationFound: "Evidence Room \xB7 evidence board"
  interactionPrompt: Study crime scene photos
  pages:
  - 'PHOTO 1  The office door, closed. Lock intact.

    PHOTO 2  The victim''s desk.
    Papers pushed aside, desk lamp still on.

    PHOTO 3  A side table by the window.
    Two coffee cups.'
  image: {fileID: 0}
  caption: Office of D. Reyes, 18 Harlow Street. Photographed 00:40 on the 15th.
  examinationNotes: 'Up close, the lock and strike plate are clean: no scratches,
    no tool marks. On the side table by the window there are two cups. Only one has
    a saucer.'
